WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.290 --> 00:00:06.540
The Alt Shift X Podcast has three episodes
out now. There’s an interview with C. M.

00:00:06.540 --> 00:00:12.710
Kosemen, the creator of that crazy sci fi
story All Tomorrows. And there’s a two-part

00:00:12.710 --> 00:00:16.510
interview with the authors of The Expanse.
They’re both really fun

00:00:16.510 --> 00:00:21.430
conversations, and you can watch now at the
links below. The podcast is on YouTube and

00:00:21.430 --> 00:00:28.360
Spotify and every podcast app.
Alt Schwift X has also been busy. There’s

00:00:28.360 --> 00:00:33.750
a seven hour long video all about Song of
Ice and Fire theories, and the one hundredth

00:00:33.750 --> 00:00:39.760
episode of the Game of Thrones Abridged Podcast
came out. There are a couple of video essays

00:00:39.760 --> 00:00:45.800
about Bojack Horseman and death and stuff.
And there’s now an Alt Schwift X gaming

00:00:45.800 --> 00:00:49.750
channel playing Dark Souls and The Binding
of Isaac.

00:00:49.750 --> 00:00:55.860
Some people think that Alt Schwift X is the
same person as Alt Shift X, but there's little evidence

00:00:55.860 --> 00:01:03.270
for that fan theory. Alt Shift X is professional and
concise with research and citations, while

00:01:03.270 --> 00:01:09.150
Alt Schwift X is an unscripted rambling hot
mess – which is why we don’t usually promote

00:01:09.150 --> 00:01:13.970
Alt Schwift X on this channel. But some of
these videos you might enjoy.

00:01:13.970 --> 00:01:20.909
There’s also another, stranger channel called
Random Article. It has some kooky storytelling

00:01:20.909 --> 00:01:27.280
stuff, and some quote-unquote “horoscopes”
that have an almost improvisational tone.

00:01:27.280 --> 00:01:31.229
If you like weird stories, you might like
that channel too.

00:01:31.229 --> 00:01:37.979
But the only true official Alt Shift X side-channel
is Alt Shift ZZZ, which has readings of old

00:01:37.979 --> 00:01:44.500
books, like audiobooks. The latest video was
The Call of Cthulhu by H. P. Lovecraft. There’s

00:01:44.500 --> 00:01:50.190
also some SCPs, some non-fiction, some religious
texts, all sorts of stuff.

00:01:50.190 --> 00:01:53.840
All of these channels and videos are linked
in the description below.

00:01:53.840 --> 00:01:59.689
Finally, check out our sponsors, CuriosityStream
and Nebula. CuriosityStream has thousands

00:01:59.689 --> 00:02:05.140
of documentaries about science and history
and nature, and Nebula has exclusive content

00:02:05.140 --> 00:02:11.629
from YouTubers like TierZoo, Volksgeist, and
Alt Shift X. Nebula’s an independent platform

00:02:11.629 --> 00:02:16.349
where we don’t have to deal with YouTube’s
algorithm and demonetisation, and can try

00:02:16.349 --> 00:02:22.400
new kinds of content. You can get CuriosityStream
and Nebula for a year for just fifteen bucks

00:02:22.400 --> 00:02:26.489
at the link below.
Thanks for watching, and thanks to the Patrons,

00:02:26.489 --> 00:02:32.799
